                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "not that this ancient game needs a review but i have played burger shop 2 since it first came out in the year of our lord 2009 and i have basically never stopped playing burger shop 2. like i don't play it every day but sometimes i am just craving something that only burger shop 2 can fulfill. i love burger shop 2 so much that i bought it from big fish games in 2009 and had it on every computer and then later on i got a new computer and i couldn't remember my big fish games password because i've had it since 2009 and so i went looking for burger shop 2 on steam and there it was waiting for me and i bought it immediately. it's just the perfect game to turn your brain off and click click click click click. my favorite mode is relax mode so i can literally just chill out and make my dumb little food. burger shop 2 my lifelong love.",
